#: main.cpp:44
msgid "KDE Crash Handler gives the user feedback if a program crashed."
msgstr "KDE Crash Handler wužiwarjej informacije podawa, hdyž je so program pójsnył."

#: main.cpp:48
msgid "The signal number that was caught"
msgstr "Čisło signala, kiž je program dóstał"

#: main.cpp:49
msgid "Name of the program"
msgstr "Mjeno programa"

#: main.cpp:50
msgid "Path to the executable"
msgstr "Puć k programej"

#: main.cpp:51
msgid "The version of the program"
msgstr "Wersija programa"

#: main.cpp:52
msgid "The bug address to use"
msgstr "Adresa za zmylki, kiž ma so wužiwać"

#: main.cpp:53
msgid "Translated name of the program"
msgstr "Přełožene mjeno programa"

#: main.cpp:54
msgid "The PID of the program"
msgstr "PID programa"

#: main.cpp:55
msgid "Startup ID of the program"
msgstr "Startowanska ID programa"

#: main.cpp:56
msgid "The program was started by kdeinit"
msgstr "Program bu wot kdeinit startowany"

#: main.cpp:70
msgid "The KDE Crash Handler"
msgstr "KDE Crash Handler"

#: debugger.cpp:66
msgid "C&opy"
msgstr "K&opěrować"

#: debugger.cpp:83
msgid "Done."
msgstr "Hotowo."

#: debugger.cpp:96
msgid "Select Filename"
msgstr "Mjeno dataje wubrać"

#: debugger.cpp:109
msgid "Can't open file %1 for writing"
msgstr "Njemóžu do dataje %1 pisać"

#: debugger.cpp:116
msgid "Unable to create backtrace."
msgstr "Njemóžu backtrace stworić."

#: debugger.cpp:121
msgid "Loading backtrace..."
msgstr "Čitam backtrace..."

#: debugger.cpp:139
msgid "Loading symbols..."
msgstr "Čitam symbole ..."

#: krashconf.cpp:62
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "njeznate"

#: drbugreport.cpp:55
msgid "You have to edit the description before the report can be sent."
msgstr "Dyrbiće wopisanje připrawić, prjedy hač móže so rozprawa wotpósłać."

#: backtrace.cpp:85
msgid ""
"%1 not found. Check if it is installed -- you need it to generate the "
"backtrace.\n"
"If you have another debugger, contact kde-devel@kde.org for help on how to "
"set it up."
msgstr ""
"Njesym %1 namakał. Přepruwujće, hač je instalowany -- je trěbne, zo by backtrace "
"stworił.\n"
"Jeli maće druhi debugger, woprašejće so pola kde-devel@kde.org, kak ma so konfigurować."

#: toplevel.cpp:60
msgid "&Bug report"
msgstr "&Rozprawa wo zmylku"

#: toplevel.cpp:61
msgid "&Debugger"
msgstr "&Debugger"

#: toplevel.cpp:65
msgid "&General"
msgstr "&Powšitkownje"

#: toplevel.cpp:80
msgid "&Backtrace"
msgstr "&Backtrace"

#: toplevel.cpp:99
msgid "<p><b>Short description</b></p><p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Krótke wopisanje</b></p><p>%1</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:103
msgid "<p><b>What is this?</b></p><p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Što to je?</b></p><p>%1</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:107
msgid "<p><b>What can I do?</b></p><p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Što móžu ja činić?</b></p><p>%1</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:112
msgid "<p><b>Application crashed</b></p><p>The program %appname crashed.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Program so pójsnył</b></p><p>Program %appname je so pójsnył.</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:131
msgid ""
"<p>Do you want to generate a backtrace? This will help the developers to "
"figure out what went wrong.</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately this will take some time on slow machines.</p><p><b>Note: A "
"backtrace is not a substitute for a proper description of the bug and "
"information on how to reproduce it. It is not possible to fix the bug "
"without a proper description.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Chceće backtrace stworić? To budźe wuwiwarjam pomhać, zo bychu zwěsćili, "
"što njeje fungowało.</p>\n"
"<p>Bohužel to na pomałkim computeru trochu traje.</p><p><b>Kedźbu: Backtrace "
"njenaruna dokładne wopisanje zmylka a informaciju, kak hodźi so zmylk prowokować. "
"Bjez dokładneho wopisanja njebudźe móžno, zmylk wotstronić.</b></p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:143
msgid "Include Backtrace"
msgstr "Dodaj backtrace"

#: toplevel.cpp:200
msgid "It was not possible to generate a backtrace."
msgstr "Njebě móžno, backtrace stworić."

#: toplevel.cpp:201
msgid "Backtrace not Possible"
msgstr "Backtrace njeje móžny"

